    <h1>Help Section: System Usage Guidelines for New Users</h1>
    <p>Welcome to the Pahana Edu Online Billing System! This system is designed to simplify managing customer accounts and billing for our bookshop. Follow these guidelines to get started:</p>
    
    <h2>1. Customer Registration</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Go to the <strong>New Customer Registration</strong> page.</li>
        <li>Fill in the required details:
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Account Number:</strong> Unique identifier for the customer.</li>
                <li><strong>Name:</strong> Full customer name.</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> Customer's mailing address.</li>
                <li><strong>Telephone Number:</strong> Contact phone number.</li>
                <li><strong>Units Consumed:</strong> Relevant unit data (if applicable).</li>
            </ul>
        </li>
        <li>Submit the form to save the new customer.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>2. Managing Customer Accounts</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Use the <strong>Search</strong> feature to find customers by account number or name.</li>
        <li>Update customer information if needed.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>3. Creating Bills</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Select a customer account to generate a new bill.</li>
        <li>Enter purchased items or units consumed.</li>
        <li>The system will automatically calculate totals.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>4. Viewing Billing History</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Access past bills and payment records for each customer.</li>
        <li>Use this for account tracking and management.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>5. System Navigation Tips</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Use the navigation menu to access different system features.</li>
        <li>Fill in all mandatory fields before submitting forms.</li>
        <li>Log out after use to secure customer data.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>6. Support</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or need help, contact IT support via the <strong>Contact Us</strong> page or call the help desk.</p>
    
